        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il charge sans distinction tout ce qui l’entoure, distribuant allègrement les coups de tête. Il extériorise ainsi son stress de ne pas voler.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "With its steel-hard stone head, it headbutts indiscriminately. This is because of the stress it feels at being unable to fly.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "鋼鉄並みの　石頭で やたら　めったら　頭突きする。 空を　飛べない　ストレスの　せいだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "そらをとぶ　とりポケモンを　みるたび うらやましくなって　ヘッドバッドで あたりのものを　こなごなに　くだく。",
